    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every step could be your last.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turnfall which is an arcade game, throws you into a grid-based adventure where danger lurks in every corner. Traverse trap-filled levels, dodge deadly enemies, and make split-second decisions that could mean survival \u2014 or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a tactical maze. Will you fight your way through or outsmart your foes and sneak past? The path is yours to choose \u2014 but there's no room for hesitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons are your lifeline, but nothing lasts forever. Swords dull, shields break, and every hit counts. Scavenge for new gear and power-ups to stay one step ahead, because when your defenses fail, you're vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are relentless, each with unique abilities and behavior. Some chase, others ambush \u2014 and all of them want you gone. Outsmart them with clever moves or run when things get tight. Sometimes retreat is the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2013 Stylish, vibrant visuals<br>\u2013 Challenging, turn-based arcade gameplay<br>\u2013 Smart enemies with unique tactics<br>\u2013 Fragile gear and high-stakes choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your instincts, plan every move, and survive the fall.</p>",
